  "triggers": [
    {
      "id": "sanctum_enter",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The Solar Sanctum. The ancient architecture reveals itself fully now — crystalline chambers arranged in concentric rings, each one focusing and amplifying the solar energy flowing from above.",
          "The heat is beyond anything your sol unit was designed for. Thermal warnings cascade across your display. The air itself shimmers, distorting reality. Energy pulses through the walls in visible waves, channeled through grooves carved with impossible precision.",
          "This is a three-dimensional focusing array — every surface, every angle, every crystal calculated to concentrate starlight into a force that could reshape matter itself. The Array spent three centuries trying to absorb this technology. It never came close."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "first_elevation_puzzle",
      "event": "room_entered",
      "conditions": [{ "not": { "hasFlag": "radiance_elevation_noted" } }],
      "actions": [
        { "type": "setFlag", "flag": "radiance_elevation_noted" },
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The elevated platforms are connected by ramps and energy bridges — but the layout forces indirect navigation through the focusing chambers. Solar conduits block direct paths, their energy lethal to touch.",
          "Your sol unit resonates with the concentrated light. The energy flowing through this place is the same energy that powers your abilities — but magnified a thousandfold. If you could channel it directly..."
        ]}
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ancient_record_pickup",
      "event": "item_picked_up",
      "filter": { "itemType": "lore_radiance_ancient_record" },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "lines": [
          "The crystalline disc projects a blueprint of the entire Spire — not as it is now, wrapped in Array machinery, but as it was built. A focusing instrument of staggering scope.",
          "The builders understood something the Array never grasped: light isn't just energy. It's information. It's structure. Concentrated correctly, it can imprint patterns on matter at the molecular level. The Photonic Pulse was their signature achievement."
        ]},
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 25 }
      ],
      "once": true
    },
    {
      "id": "crystal_pickup",
      "event": "item_picked_up",
      "filter": { "itemType": "solar_focusing_crystal" },
      "actions": [
        { "type": "showMessage", "text": "The crystal thrums in your hand. It was grown — not carved, not manufactured — by a process that treated crystalline structure as living architecture. The Array tried to synthesize these for three centuries. Every attempt shattered." },
        { "type": "grantXp", "amount": 15 }
      ],
      "once": true
    }
  ]
